flowchart LR

A[Threat Actor]
--> B[Phishing Email]

B --> C[Email Security Gateway]

C --> D{Blocked?}

D -- Yes --> E[Attack Stopped]

D -- No --> F[User Receives Email]

F --> G[User Awareness Training]

G --> H{User Reports or Avoids?}

H -- Yes --> E

H -- No --> I[Malicious Attachment Executed]

I --> J[Endpoint Protection / EDR]

J --> K{Malware Detected?}

K -- Yes --> L[Endpoint Isolated]

K -- No --> M[XLoader Executes]

M --> N[DNS Security Layer]

N --> O{Malicious Domain Blocked?}

O -- Yes --> E

O -- No --> P[External Communication Attempt]

P --> Q[Network Monitoring / IDS]

Q --> R{Suspicious Traffic Detected?}

R -- Yes --> S[SIEM Alert Created]

R -- No --> T[Potential C2 Communication]

S --> U[Incident Response]

L --> U

U --> V[Containment and Recovery]

T --> W[Business Risk]

V --> X[Reduced Impact]

W --> Y[Credential Theft / Data Exposure Risk]
